This product contains code ported from, and calibration data taken from, the works below. Each
entry says where its code is used and gives the licence, reproduced in full at the end.

1. pixelmatch (ISC)
   Copyright (c) 2025, Mapbox; author Volodymyr Agafonkin
   https://github.com/mapbox/pixelmatch
   Ported in:
     packages/engine/src/yiq.ts      lumaIq, colourDelta, MAX_YIQ_DELTA
     engines/wasm/src/lib.rs         MAX_YIQ_DELTA, blended, luma, luma_iq, colour_delta,
                                     has_many_siblings, is_antialiased
     engines/dotnet/PixelSlash.Diff/Diff.cs
                                     MaxYiqDelta, Luma, ColourDelta, HasManySiblings, IsAntialiased
   The YIQ coefficients, the 35215 maximum delta and the neighbour tests follow pixelmatch's
   YIQ colour delta.

2. pngjs (MIT)
   Copyright (c) 2015 Luke Page & Original Contributors; Copyright (c) 2012 Kuba Niegowski
   https://github.com/pngjs/pngjs
   Ported in:
     engines/wasm/src/lib.rs         paeth, unfilter, unfilter_pixels, PASSES, passes,
                                     line_bytes, unfilter_line, decode, filter_sums, filter_row,
                                     filter (the PNG decoder and the overlay's adaptive filter)
     packages/engine/src/png-walk.ts headerOf, readTrns, walkPng (the chunk parser, after
                                     pngjs's sync reader and its error messages)

3. Papers the engine's colour and anti-alias maths rests on (no text is copied)
   - Kotsarenko, N. and Ramos, F. (2010). Measuring perceived color difference using YIQ NTSC
     transmission color space in mobile applications. The YIQ weights behind the colour delta,
     as pixelmatch cites them.
   - Vysniauskas, V. (2009). Anti-aliased Pixel and Intensity Slope Detector. The anti-alias test
     (engines/wasm/src/lib.rs is_antialiased; engines/dotnet/PixelSlash.Diff/Diff.cs
     IsAntialiased), as pixelmatch cites it.

4. Argos calibration cases (MIT)
   Copyright 2017 Olivier Tassinari & Greg Bergé; https://github.com/argos-ci/argos
   Pinned at 21e8520c28129d501b22028a5499546b03336e38 (ops/argos-bench/Dockerfile).
   bench/src/calibration.ts copies the case names, thresholds and expected verdicts of Argos's
   own __fixtures__ table. No image from that set is stored in this repository.

